WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.355
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:07.625 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

3
01:42.785 --> 01:44.305
I don't buy it.

4
01:44.385 --> 01:45.465
Nothing's wrong?

5
01:45.545 --> 01:48.945
Then why did you end up in the hospital and take a whole day of sick leave?

6
01:49.025 --> 01:51.865
I warned you before not to travel so much.

7
01:51.945 --> 01:53.105
See what happened?

8
01:53.185 --> 01:56.545
When did you ever warn me? You definitely didn't.

9
01:56.625 --> 01:58.785
Because you knew I had a fire in my belly.

10
01:58.865 --> 01:59.945
I just couldn't accept it.

11
02:00.025 --> 02:03.265
You beat me to project manager so much earlier.

12
02:03.345 --> 02:05.585
Even if you took it over halfway through.

13
02:06.745 --> 02:09.265
Show some respect in front of your superior.

14
02:09.345 --> 02:11.425
Okay, okay, boss.

15
02:11.505 --> 02:13.505
Don't worry. I definitely won't push myself that hard anymore.

16
02:13.585 --> 02:14.505
If I end up in the hospital again,

17
02:14.585 --> 02:16.625
I'll drink ten bottles of your nourishing soup.

18
02:17.545 --> 02:18.705
Let's talk business.

19
02:19.505 --> 02:20.625
Once you're done with your project,

20
02:20.705 --> 02:22.625
do you want to help me keep an eye on the actuarial side?

21
02:23.385 --> 02:24.345
I'll pass.

22
02:24.425 --> 02:26.345
I want to take it easy next week.

23
02:26.425 --> 02:28.025
Once things wrap up with the IT Department,

24
02:28.105 --> 02:30.025
I'll cut back on overtime and spend more time with him.

25
02:30.945 --> 02:32.185
You're not working overtime?

26
02:34.825 --> 02:39.585
I feel like I really need to rethink the meaning of my life.

27
02:41.825 --> 02:44.065
The meaning of life?

28
02:44.665 --> 02:45.745
Don't tell me you're gonna--

29
02:49.625 --> 02:52.185
Getting sick actually changed you a bit, huh?

30
02:53.345 --> 02:54.985
If you wanna say I got prettier, just say it.

31
02:55.065 --> 02:57.265
Let me tell you, 12 hours of sleep works better than any cosmetic procedure.

32
02:57.945 --> 02:59.385
Look at those dark circles of yours…

33
02:59.465 --> 03:00.585
Those are natural.

34
03:09.945 --> 03:12.425
What's wrong? You two got into it again?

35
03:24.465 --> 03:26.465
What is wrong with Shen Jin?

36
03:26.545 --> 03:27.985
I just saw him posting lovey-dovey stuff with Lin

37
03:28.065 --> 03:29.705
on Moments a couple of days ago.

38
03:29.785 --> 03:31.545
I'll have Lin tear him a new one.

39
03:32.145 --> 03:33.185
What good would that do?

40
03:35.425 --> 03:37.825
Actually, Zhao Heng was right.

41
03:38.545 --> 03:40.465
I think I've been avoiding it.

42
03:40.545 --> 03:41.825
I don't think

43
03:41.905 --> 03:44.825
I've ever really treated him like a real boyfriend.

44
03:44.905 --> 03:46.785
You know what the problem is, so fix it.

45
03:46.865 --> 03:47.985
It's not that easy.

46
03:49.825 --> 03:54.145
You watched him scheme step by step to win me over.

47
03:54.225 --> 03:55.065
Yeah.

48
03:55.145 --> 03:56.465
He treats me really well.

49
03:56.545 --> 04:00.225
But when he suddenly goes cold on me, I get scared he's gaslighting me.

50
04:00.825 --> 04:02.825
If I give in this time, what if one day

51
04:02.905 --> 04:04.505
he gets stronger

52
04:04.585 --> 04:06.145
and decides he won't put up with my bad temper anymore?

53
04:06.225 --> 04:07.465
What do I do then?

54
04:08.465 --> 04:09.585
And my dad…

55
04:09.665 --> 04:11.065
My dad won't give me anything.

56
04:11.145 --> 04:12.825
He's leaving it all to my brother. What am I supposed to do?

57
04:16.585 --> 04:17.825
I get it.

58
04:19.025 --> 04:22.705
At the end of the day, you're just scared you'll lose in this relationship.

59
04:22.785 --> 04:25.785
You're actually nowhere near as confident as you pretend to be.

60
04:26.665 --> 04:27.665
-That's not it. -Not it?

61
04:27.745 --> 04:29.425
-No. -Okay then.

62
04:29.505 --> 04:31.145
Then just keep giving him the cold shoulder like before.

63
04:31.225 --> 04:33.305
But what if he doesn't come to me anymore?

64
04:33.385 --> 04:36.105
Let him go, of course. There are plenty of men out there.

65
04:36.185 --> 04:37.625
-No. -Why not?

66
04:37.705 --> 04:39.225
I like him. I can't be without--

67
04:45.385 --> 04:47.865
Missy, stop pretending you're tough.

68
04:47.945 --> 04:50.905
Since you like him, just be firm and brave.

69
04:50.985 --> 04:52.825
Love isn't strategic consulting.

70
04:52.905 --> 04:54.545
You don't need to plan every move.

71
04:54.625 --> 04:56.905
Yeah, no one knows what the future holds.

72
04:56.985 --> 04:58.105
But at least enjoy the present.

73
05:05.545 --> 05:08.225
Forget it. Just do whatever.

74
05:08.305 --> 05:10.545
Anyway, there are tons of rich, pretty girls out there.

75
05:10.625 --> 05:12.385
After he finishes the Celestial project,

76
05:12.465 --> 05:15.145
he can take that track record to the next company and find someone new.

77
05:15.225 --> 05:16.825
I think that works too.

78
05:23.425 --> 05:25.545
It's me. Come to the front desk right now.

79
05:25.625 --> 05:26.625
I need to talk to you.

80
05:31.065 --> 05:32.465
-Come with me. -Where to?

81
05:32.545 --> 05:33.385
To meet clients.

82
05:40.145 --> 05:42.185
International Equestrian Culture Week?

83
05:42.265 --> 05:43.665
What are clients doing here?

84
05:49.505 --> 05:51.505
‎-Isn't that one my horse? ‎-Yes, you are right.

85
05:53.025 --> 05:54.665
-Dad! -Look, that one's picking up.

86
05:59.105 --> 06:00.785
Hello, Mr. Liu, Mr. Wang.

87
06:00.865 --> 06:03.305
Nana's getting prettier and prettier.

88
06:03.385 --> 06:05.625
Such a striking presence.

89
06:05.705 --> 06:06.905
What are you doing here?

90
06:07.505 --> 06:09.305
Siwei sponsored so many great events.

91
06:09.385 --> 06:11.105
Of course, I had to come check it out.

92
06:11.625 --> 06:14.945
Oh, let me introduce you to my boyfriend, Zhao Heng.

93
06:15.025 --> 06:16.545
He's also my colleague at Maxmise.

94
06:18.465 --> 06:20.225
Nana's got good taste.

95
06:20.825 --> 06:22.385
Really good. Not bad at all.

96
06:23.185 --> 06:24.225
Say hi.

97
06:27.225 --> 06:28.865
-Hi, Mr. Bu. -Hello.

98
06:28.945 --> 06:30.465
Hello, Mr. Liu, Mr. Wang.

99
06:31.825 --> 06:34.185
I'll go say hi to the other elders.

100
06:36.945 --> 06:38.185
Nana…

101
06:38.265 --> 06:39.585
Look at Nana's boyfriend.

102
06:39.665 --> 06:40.865
He's actually pretty great.

103
06:42.265 --> 06:43.505
Nice. Nice.

104
06:50.025 --> 06:51.465
Weren't you forcing me to choose?

105
06:51.545 --> 06:52.985
Now I've chosen.

106
06:53.065 --> 06:56.225
I just told my dad and all his friends that you're my boyfriend.

107
06:56.905 --> 06:58.545
-There's no backing out now. -Wait, Tianna--

108
06:58.625 --> 07:00.265
Save it. Let me tell you.

109
07:00.345 --> 07:02.385
Right now, my dad cares too much about his precious image

110
07:02.465 --> 07:03.745
to come running out and yell at me.

111
07:03.825 --> 07:05.745
But after this, I'm definitely in for a storm.

112
07:06.785 --> 07:08.625
Weren't you determined to be the ultimate schemer?

113
07:08.705 --> 07:11.385
Then you must have all kinds of plans for dealing with my dad.

114
07:11.465 --> 07:13.025
Put them together and send them over to me.

115
07:13.105 --> 07:14.265
I'm heading back to Celestial.

116
07:31.345 --> 07:32.185
What are you doing?

117
07:34.105 --> 07:35.625
Happy wife, happy life.

118
07:37.625 --> 07:39.185
I'm really happy right now.

119
07:39.265 --> 07:42.905
Because you must love me so much to say all that in front of your dad.

120
07:42.985 --> 07:45.345
From what I know, you're not usually that bold.

121
07:45.425 --> 07:47.265
Stop talking nonsense. What do you know?

122
07:49.305 --> 07:50.385
I just know.

123
08:16.225 --> 08:17.265
Yuanzhou Gallery is suspected

124
08:17.345 --> 08:19.265
of colluding with overseas platforms in a rat-trading scheme.

125
08:19.345 --> 08:20.465
Market value has plunged nearly 60%.

126
08:20.545 --> 08:21.665
-Back up! -Regulators

127
08:21.745 --> 08:23.305
-have moved in to investigate on site. -Step back!

128
08:23.385 --> 08:24.225
Back up!

129
08:24.305 --> 08:25.185
Step back.

130
08:25.265 --> 08:26.785
Don't push!

131
08:26.865 --> 08:27.945
Give us an answer!

132
08:29.785 --> 08:31.065
Xinzhi!

133
08:31.585 --> 08:32.784
Come quick!

134
08:34.305 --> 08:35.144
What's wrong?

135
08:35.225 --> 08:36.585
You guys move fast.

136
08:36.664 --> 08:38.545
-I looked away for a few days, -Step back!

137
08:38.625 --> 08:39.664
and it's already come to this?

138
08:39.745 --> 08:41.985
-Step back! -Pay up!

139
08:42.065 --> 08:43.865
While you were wrapping up the Celestial project,

140
08:43.945 --> 08:45.105
-Du and I were busy with this. -Please comment on the situation!

141
08:45.785 --> 08:47.345
Once the first domino falls,

142
08:47.425 --> 08:48.665
the rest will follow.

143
08:54.785 --> 08:56.185
He had it coming.

144
08:56.265 --> 08:58.385
Karma never misses.

145
08:58.985 --> 09:01.305
He's been reaching out to everyone he can lately.

146
09:02.025 --> 09:04.025
I only went on that business trip because I didn't want to see him.

147
09:08.905 --> 09:10.025
You sly fox.

148
09:13.145 --> 09:15.385
Move aside! Step back!

149
09:15.465 --> 09:18.025
Don't push. Step back.

150
09:18.745 --> 09:19.745
Say it again.

151
09:20.825 --> 09:22.065
I like hearing it.

152
09:31.545 --> 09:32.745
You bit me.

153
09:33.345 --> 09:35.025
I like hearing that too.

154
10:20.505 --> 10:21.425
Mom.

155
10:25.785 --> 10:27.065
Mrs. Bu. Hello.

156
10:27.145 --> 10:28.145
I brought you your favorite

157
10:28.225 --> 10:29.665
-Zhang's Crispy Pastries. -Right.

158
10:29.745 --> 10:31.825
Come to the table. The food's getting cold.

159
10:35.145 --> 10:38.225
Tianna, where's the toy you brought me?

160
10:40.585 --> 10:42.425
-Right here. -Say thank you to Zhao Heng.

161
10:43.025 --> 10:45.185
Wrong. It's Brother-in-Law Zhao.

162
10:49.465 --> 10:51.465
Let me ask you, where's Dad?

163
10:51.545 --> 10:53.345
Was he mad? Did he lose his temper?

164
10:53.425 --> 10:58.505
He just fought with Mom and smashed a cup.

165
10:59.065 --> 11:00.185
It's fine. We'll play it by ear.

166
11:00.265 --> 11:01.185
Dad… Dad.

167
11:01.265 --> 11:03.505
Jie, stop playing. Come eat.

168
11:03.585 --> 11:04.585
‎Okay.

169
11:08.105 --> 11:10.025
What's going on? The silent treatment?

170
11:12.625 --> 11:13.465
It's fine.

171
11:25.905 --> 11:26.985
Eat.

172
11:48.465 --> 11:49.305
Eat up.

173
11:57.785 --> 12:01.305
-Dad. Mom. -No talking at meals.

174
12:01.385 --> 12:04.145
Don't forget the rules your mom taught you.

175
12:04.225 --> 12:06.345
After all, that's the Bu family upbringing.

176
12:06.425 --> 12:08.265
Especially with an outsider here.

177
12:22.305 --> 12:23.145
Mom.

178
12:23.785 --> 12:24.985
I want to go to the bathroom.

179
12:26.345 --> 12:28.025
Take him, ma'am.

180
12:28.105 --> 12:31.185
No. Mom, I want you to take me.

181
12:32.545 --> 12:34.345
Go on. Take him.

182
12:34.425 --> 12:35.425
Okay.

183
12:36.625 --> 12:37.905
I'll take him.

184
12:44.225 --> 12:45.185
You brat.

185
12:49.545 --> 12:50.385
Let's go.

186
13:00.025 --> 13:01.225
I'm done eating.

187
13:03.865 --> 13:04.705
Dad!

188
13:06.985 --> 13:08.745
I brought a whole living, breathing person home.

189
13:08.825 --> 13:10.705
You can't just act like you don't see him.

190
13:11.785 --> 13:12.985
I see him.

191
13:13.065 --> 13:14.585
What else do you expect from me?

192
13:14.665 --> 13:16.065
He's my boyfriend!

193
13:16.145 --> 13:17.145
Enough.

194
13:18.545 --> 13:22.785
Tianna, how you define your relationship is your own business.

195
13:22.865 --> 13:23.705
You're all grown up.

196
13:23.785 --> 13:26.265
Your mom and I respect you unconditionally.

197
13:26.345 --> 13:27.425
Do whatever you want.

198
13:29.025 --> 13:30.145
I'm pregnant!

199
13:32.105 --> 13:35.225
Are you gonna stay indifferent after hearing that too?

200
13:38.185 --> 13:39.065
You're not lying to me, are you?

201
13:39.145 --> 13:41.025
I'm not. It's been three months!

202
13:42.145 --> 13:44.465
Have you no shame?

203
13:45.625 --> 13:46.945
Are you okay?

204
13:48.585 --> 13:50.505
What are you doing, Dad?

205
13:50.585 --> 13:51.985
I'm fine. It's alright.

206
13:54.785 --> 13:57.225
Mr. Bu, she's just saying that out of spite.

207
13:57.825 --> 13:59.465
We haven't reached that point yet.

208
14:00.105 --> 14:01.025
Don't worry.

209
14:11.465 --> 14:12.305
It's okay.

210
14:15.905 --> 14:17.425
I know you definitely don't like me,

211
14:17.505 --> 14:18.785
but considering that slap I just took,

212
14:19.825 --> 14:22.265
could you please spare me three minutes

213
14:22.865 --> 14:23.945
to hear me out?

214
14:28.905 --> 14:29.945
Speak.

215
14:31.785 --> 14:32.945
It's fine.

216
14:35.865 --> 14:39.665
I know why you allowed me at the table earlier.

217
14:41.545 --> 14:42.465
And I know…

218
14:45.305 --> 14:46.865
why you gave me the silent treatment.

219
14:48.105 --> 14:49.465
Because you know perfectly well

220
14:49.545 --> 14:51.465
that forcing us apart…

221
14:53.345 --> 14:54.505
would only trigger Tianna's rebellion.

222
14:56.025 --> 14:59.425
Who knows, we might end up even more inseparable.

223
15:01.865 --> 15:04.505
But the cold shoulder is a whole different game.

224
15:05.105 --> 15:08.345
You know I'll be stewing with frustration.

225
15:08.865 --> 15:10.065
And once the honeymoon phase fades,

226
15:10.145 --> 15:12.385
you figure a punk like me,

227
15:12.465 --> 15:14.225
with his pride bruised,

228
15:14.305 --> 15:16.665
would end up in a huge fight with Tianna.

229
15:17.665 --> 15:20.865
Is that slick tongue of yours how you won Tianna over?

230
15:22.865 --> 15:23.865
Plus this face and my brain.

231
15:26.425 --> 15:27.785
You might not know this,

232
15:28.585 --> 15:30.505
but Tianna and I have actually talked a lot.

233
15:31.545 --> 15:32.465
I know what you want.

234
15:35.665 --> 15:36.585
A legacy that lasts forever, right?

235
15:37.945 --> 15:41.145
The fact that I can work alongside Tianna already proves what I'm capable of.

236
15:41.225 --> 15:44.105
If you're really not sure Tianna can handle the company on her own,

237
15:44.185 --> 15:47.145
then would bringing me into the picture boost the odds?

238
15:54.625 --> 15:56.265
And I know what you're worried about.

239
15:57.465 --> 15:58.865
I can sign a notarized agreement with you.

240
15:59.625 --> 16:00.705
I promise

241
16:01.265 --> 16:04.985
that I'll never, directly or indirectly, hold any equity in Siwei Group.

242
16:05.985 --> 16:07.025
And…

243
16:08.585 --> 16:10.025
if Tianna and I ever break up…

244
16:13.425 --> 16:15.385
I'll lose all management authority immediately.

245
16:24.305 --> 16:26.665
After all, passion is fleeting,

246
16:26.745 --> 16:27.905
but interests are forever.

247
16:29.145 --> 16:30.625
As long as I'm working toward my own future,

248
16:30.705 --> 16:32.105
I'll always love her.

249
16:35.625 --> 16:36.465
What do you think?

250
16:38.265 --> 16:39.305
Dad.

251
16:49.705 --> 16:52.065
Tianna, come play with me.

252
16:53.185 --> 16:54.025
Stop it.

253
16:54.745 --> 16:56.225
I'll join you guys in a bit. Okay?

254
16:56.305 --> 16:57.705
Even better!

255
16:58.345 --> 16:59.945
Jie, quit messing around.

256
17:02.425 --> 17:03.265
Come with me.

257
17:04.265 --> 17:05.305
A quick word with you.

258
17:46.945 --> 17:47.945
Does it hurt?

259
17:49.105 --> 17:49.945
It's okay.

260
17:51.025 --> 17:53.705
So, how would you rate my performance today?

261
17:57.225 --> 17:59.705
What's wrong? Not happy?

262
18:01.345 --> 18:03.505
I know. It's definitely because of what I said to your dad.

263
18:04.105 --> 18:05.225
He's a businessman.

264
18:05.305 --> 18:08.025
The only way he'd actually listen to me

265
18:08.105 --> 18:10.465
was if I talked to him in terms of pros and cons.

266
18:11.305 --> 18:13.065
How much do you love me for me,

267
18:13.145 --> 18:17.385
and how much for what I can give you?

268
18:20.305 --> 18:22.425
You, 70%. The benefits, 30%.

269
18:24.545 --> 18:25.745
Not bad.

270
18:25.825 --> 18:27.945
At least it's not 50-50 or 60-40.

271
18:29.225 --> 18:30.665
Come on.

272
18:30.745 --> 18:33.025
I won't repeat all those sweet things to you.

273
18:33.105 --> 18:38.265
I want us to work together to turn whatever benefits you bring

274
18:38.345 --> 18:40.065
into our shared benefits.

275
19:01.105 --> 19:02.385
Don't let me down.

276
19:03.265 --> 19:04.385
Got it.

277
19:08.065 --> 19:09.985
My work is pretty much done here.

278
19:10.065 --> 19:12.065
I won't go to Celestial today.

279
19:12.145 --> 19:14.945
I'll give you and Zhao Heng some alone time.

280
19:17.665 --> 19:19.545
Miss Xu. You have to help me.

281
19:20.305 --> 19:21.385
The bank pulled my loan approval.

282
19:21.465 --> 19:23.225
Mr. Deng says the earn-out clause has been triggered.

283
19:23.305 --> 19:24.305
He wants me to sell

284
19:24.385 --> 19:26.545
-all my shares per the agreement. -Bye.

285
19:27.065 --> 19:28.745
Richard's gone off the grid.

286
19:29.305 --> 19:30.545
You're the only one who can help me now.

287
19:31.425 --> 19:32.465
You brokered the funding

288
19:32.545 --> 19:33.825
for Yuanzhou and Morse.

289
19:33.905 --> 19:36.465
So, you have to ask Mr. Deng

290
19:36.545 --> 19:38.385
-to give me more time. -Sorry.

291
19:38.465 --> 19:40.265
I only know how to broker deals.

292
19:40.345 --> 19:41.985
Don't know anything about what comes after.

293
19:42.065 --> 19:43.385
You should just talk to Mr. Deng.

294
19:43.465 --> 19:45.305
Sorry, I have to go.

295
19:47.505 --> 19:51.505
Walk out that door, and I swear I'll ruin your face.

296
20:00.985 --> 20:02.305
I'm not that stupid.

297
20:02.385 --> 20:05.025
At this point, I know

298
20:05.105 --> 20:08.305
you and Ye Xinzhi teamed up to set a trap for me.

299
20:08.385 --> 20:10.785
He knows me. Tell him to come see me.

300
20:10.865 --> 20:14.905
Otherwise, if I'm pushed to the edge, no one gets off easy.

301
20:26.545 --> 20:28.665
Trying to add intentional assault

302
20:28.745 --> 20:30.225
to your financial crimes, are you?

303
20:32.185 --> 20:33.945
Then you won't be the only one going down.

304
20:35.025 --> 20:35.905
Your kid goes down with you.

305
20:49.145 --> 20:50.545
Are you trying to push me over the edge?

306
21:09.065 --> 21:10.065
‎YE XINZHI

307
21:10.145 --> 21:12.625
Du said Wen Ruosen came to C&amp;C looking for me.

308
21:12.705 --> 21:15.265
If he comes to you too, bring him to me.

309
21:53.065 --> 21:54.145
Xinzhi.

310
21:54.225 --> 21:55.945
My kid's only eight.

311
21:57.585 --> 21:58.665
I really don't want to jump off a building.

312
21:59.505 --> 22:02.585
But if you don't save me, I really will jump.

313
22:03.105 --> 22:04.825
Are you really going to watch me do it?

314
22:07.745 --> 22:09.825
Xinzhi. I'm begging you.

315
22:11.585 --> 22:12.465
Save me.

316
23:10.465 --> 23:12.305
No need for that. Chi.

317
23:12.385 --> 23:13.585
Can you grab some food?

318
23:13.665 --> 23:16.065
He definitely hasn't been eating properly lately.

319
23:16.145 --> 23:17.065
He can't even stand straight.

320
23:30.785 --> 23:34.225
HANDMADE EGG ROLL COOKIES

321
23:34.305 --> 23:36.865
If we're talking taste, I'd recommend…

322
23:39.065 --> 23:40.705
This one's got the best flavor.

323
23:41.305 --> 23:42.145
Thanks.

324
23:45.065 --> 23:46.105
Let me introduce myself.

325
23:47.465 --> 23:48.825
I'm Wang Yuan, Woody.

326
23:49.545 --> 23:50.505
An associate partner at C&amp;C.

327
23:51.665 --> 23:53.065
Hi. I'm Xu Chi.

328
23:53.665 --> 23:56.305
I don't work here. I'm Richard's guest.

329
23:56.385 --> 23:58.545
I know who you are. You're one of Maxmise's top people.

330
23:59.785 --> 24:01.465
Mr. Zheng from Celestial is an old classmate of mine.

331
24:01.545 --> 24:03.385
He brings you up all the time.

332
24:03.465 --> 24:05.425
Always singing your praises.

333
24:13.705 --> 24:15.025
So this is the best we can do?

334
24:15.105 --> 24:16.905
It's the best possible way out

335
24:16.985 --> 24:18.185
I could offer you.

336
24:26.665 --> 24:27.585
Thank you.

337
24:39.625 --> 24:40.465
Very well.

338
24:42.425 --> 24:43.745
Ye Xinzhi.

339
24:44.785 --> 24:45.625
You're ruthless.

340
24:45.705 --> 24:48.065
Just because I made you take the fall back then,

341
24:48.145 --> 24:52.505
you spent ten whole years scheming to get back at me.

342
24:54.465 --> 24:55.385
What are you talking about?

343
24:57.065 --> 24:58.105
Doesn't matter.

344
24:58.785 --> 25:00.905
You'll end up like me sooner or later.

345
25:00.985 --> 25:02.665
Publicly vilified.

346
25:02.745 --> 25:04.225
Scandal everywhere.

347
25:04.305 --> 25:05.905
You won't escape any of it.

348
25:08.145 --> 25:09.185
Is that so?

349
25:14.425 --> 25:16.185
I trained you back then.

350
25:17.225 --> 25:19.145
Now you're training her.

351
25:19.225 --> 25:21.105
You are my payback.

352
25:21.905 --> 25:24.265
And she is your payback down the road.

353
25:26.625 --> 25:30.425
Because she is colder than you and way more ruthless.

354
25:30.505 --> 25:33.105
One day, she'll kick you to the curb

355
25:33.185 --> 25:35.505
and take your place completely.

356
26:09.225 --> 26:10.425
Done talking?

357
26:17.145 --> 26:18.585
I gave him a plan.

358
26:19.545 --> 26:20.825
Things have come to this.

359
26:21.825 --> 26:25.945
He has to hand over all his shares per the earn-out agreement.

360
26:27.945 --> 26:31.705
Eighty percent of the sale proceeds

361
26:31.785 --> 26:34.265
go to compensating the victims from Jingshang Department Store

362
26:34.345 --> 26:36.105
for what they went through.

363
26:37.065 --> 26:38.465
The remaining 20% covers fines

364
26:39.545 --> 26:42.865
and offsets the losses of employees and investors.

365
26:46.025 --> 26:48.545
I also introduced him to my good friend, lawyer Bai Xiao.

366
26:49.945 --> 26:53.225
If he really has no criminal liability,

367
26:54.425 --> 26:55.705
I'll go talk to Deng

368
26:56.465 --> 27:00.145
and see if I can get his industry ban waived.

369
27:01.225 --> 27:02.865
This isn't what you originally planned?

370
27:07.865 --> 27:08.865
Can't just drive him into the ground.

371
27:11.905 --> 27:13.345
I can't exactly

372
27:16.585 --> 27:17.505
push him to jump, can I?

373
27:33.705 --> 27:35.625
So what's he got left in the end?

374
27:38.345 --> 27:41.065
With his drive, if he looks for the right opening,

375
27:41.145 --> 27:42.985
he could still make a comeback, I think.

376
27:44.465 --> 27:45.785
Just like I did back then.

377
27:47.345 --> 27:49.465
But he's getting old.

378
27:49.985 --> 27:51.985
He doesn't have the edge you had back then.

379
27:56.385 --> 27:58.145
Your plan was a complete success.

380
27:59.105 --> 28:01.945
I thought you'd be thrilled.

381
28:03.185 --> 28:04.665
I thought so too.

382
28:05.305 --> 28:06.665
Maybe when I saw

383
28:07.625 --> 28:11.305
Yuanzhou's employees being hauled in for questioning,

384
28:12.425 --> 28:13.865
all of them scared out of their minds…

385
28:16.105 --> 28:17.105
I started to regret it a little.

386
28:20.305 --> 28:21.425
I get it.

387
28:23.505 --> 28:27.025
I don't think I can just casually comfort you and say,

388
28:27.665 --> 28:30.905
if they really broke the law, then getting taken in is only fair.

389
28:31.585 --> 28:34.825
And if they're innocent, the law will clear their names.

390
28:36.065 --> 28:38.105
Because I've also been through a suspension and an investigation.

391
28:38.185 --> 28:40.945
Back then, I knew I was innocent,

392
28:41.025 --> 28:43.545
but inside, I was still filled with dread and fear.

393
28:47.905 --> 28:51.025
And even if they're really fine,

394
28:51.745 --> 28:53.945
based on how Morse usually handles assets,

395
28:54.665 --> 28:56.745
most of them will still get laid off.

396
29:04.545 --> 29:09.265
We chose this high-risk industry and took the high pay,

397
29:09.345 --> 29:11.465
so we should be mentally prepared for instability.

398
29:13.945 --> 29:15.265
But we're all human.

399
29:15.865 --> 29:16.945
We have feelings.

400
29:17.465 --> 29:19.025
We hurt. We get scared.

401
29:27.265 --> 29:28.265
Yeah.

402
29:31.385 --> 29:32.585
Revenge…

403
29:34.945 --> 29:35.865
isn't exactly a happy thing.

404
29:38.065 --> 29:39.345
I never thought

405
29:40.025 --> 29:41.625
that hitting a ten-year goal

406
29:43.345 --> 29:44.785
out of nowhere

407
29:46.225 --> 29:47.145
would feel like this.

408
29:50.745 --> 29:52.225
I think I'm suddenly…

409
29:55.785 --> 29:57.065
a little lost.

410
30:03.865 --> 30:05.105
I think I am too, a bit.

411
30:06.025 --> 30:08.225
The Celestial project is almost over.

412
30:11.065 --> 30:12.105
What?

413
30:13.745 --> 30:15.185
Come on, I'll join you for a drink.

414
32:21.065 --> 32:24.185
To the Celestial Insurance project wrapping up smoothly. Cheers.

415
32:24.265 --> 32:25.785
-Cheers. -Cheers!

416
32:29.465 --> 32:30.425
Great work this time.

417
32:30.505 --> 32:32.625
-Thanks for looking out for me. -Hope we work together again.

418
32:33.225 --> 32:34.985
‎This one just ended. ‎The next one's about to start.

419
32:35.065 --> 32:36.225
Yes. It's about to start.

420
32:38.705 --> 32:40.385
-Come on, let's drink. -Come on.

421
32:41.865 --> 32:42.865
Come on.

422
32:42.945 --> 32:43.945
What's wrong?

423
32:49.345 --> 32:53.865
I just realized this is the first project we finished at Maxmise.

424
32:54.545 --> 32:55.385
I'm a little sad to see it end.

425
32:57.305 --> 32:58.585
Getting sentimental?

426
32:59.145 --> 33:01.585
It's only the first year. There are decades ahead.

427
33:01.665 --> 33:02.825
There'll definitely be dozens

428
33:02.905 --> 33:04.665
or hundreds of even better projects waiting for us.

429
33:05.465 --> 33:06.825
Come on.

430
33:06.905 --> 33:08.985
Our future is gonna be out of this world.

431
33:10.705 --> 33:11.785
-Out of this world. -Here.

432
33:11.865 --> 33:13.105
Come on, cheers.

433
33:20.985 --> 33:21.825
Xu Chi.

434
33:23.745 --> 33:25.545
You're on the beach right now. Here.

435
33:25.625 --> 33:28.465
Take a look. Which of these projects are you interested in?

436
33:28.545 --> 33:29.585
Okay.

437
33:36.105 --> 33:36.945
PROJECT PROPOSAL OF ANTAI UNITED INSURANCE

438
33:37.025 --> 33:37.865
PROJECT PROPOSAL OF HUARUI INSURANCE

439
33:37.945 --> 33:40.025
Why are they all insurance companies?

440
33:41.025 --> 33:42.425
You just finished the Celestial project.

441
33:42.505 --> 33:43.905
You know this industry inside out.

442
33:45.265 --> 33:48.185
Sha Sha's giving you a shot. You know your stuff.

443
33:48.265 --> 33:50.385
Once you join the team, you'll be the go-to person.

444
33:50.465 --> 33:53.705
After this project, you'll be set to move up to consultant.

445
33:53.785 --> 33:57.305
But I don't want to get stuck bouncing around one industry this early.

446
33:57.945 --> 33:59.185
Actually, I'm more interested

447
33:59.265 --> 34:00.905
in the broader space of digital finance.

448
34:02.585 --> 34:03.705
A lot of the time,

449
34:03.785 --> 34:07.425
your personal interests and your career path just don't line up.

450
34:07.505 --> 34:10.185
So you have to think it through and know what to give up.

451
34:10.784 --> 34:12.225
Isn't there a way to have both?

452
34:13.264 --> 34:18.344
I hope the company can give me more say in my own career development.

453
34:18.425 --> 34:19.665
Everyone wants that.

454
34:20.585 --> 34:23.304
If you ever find a company like that, call me right away.

455
34:23.385 --> 34:24.425
We'll leave together.

456
34:42.264 --> 34:43.145
Lin.

457
34:43.824 --> 34:46.465
I've got another career question.

458
34:46.545 --> 34:48.025
Can you help me figure it out?

459
34:50.545 --> 34:51.585
Sure.

460
34:55.425 --> 34:56.705
Ms. Sha.

461
34:58.465 --> 34:59.505
Come in.

462
35:01.745 --> 35:03.785
Have you thought it over? Which project?

463
35:16.465 --> 35:18.705
C&amp;C CONSULTING

464
35:32.985 --> 35:33.825
Mr. Ye.

465
35:34.625 --> 35:35.945
The files you asked for.

466
35:36.025 --> 35:37.825
-Thanks. Nice work. -No worries.

467
35:37.905 --> 35:38.905
You're the one pulling the long hours.

468
35:38.985 --> 35:40.785
You were in Hong Kong, China, for a whole week,

469
35:40.865 --> 35:42.305
didn't even go home, and came straight to the office?

470
35:42.385 --> 35:44.705
I need to wrap up what's on my plate first,

471
35:44.785 --> 35:46.345
then I might take a long break.

472
35:47.265 --> 35:48.505
What kind of leave?

473
35:48.585 --> 35:50.505
Don't tell me it's marriage leave?

474
35:56.625 --> 35:57.465
New hire again?

475
35:57.545 --> 35:58.905
Yes.

476
35:58.985 --> 36:02.945
Wang Yuan poached a really sharp girl to come on as a consultant.

477
36:03.585 --> 36:06.345
Starting today, you're part of the C&amp;C consulting team.

478
36:06.425 --> 36:08.385
Welcome to the C&amp;C family.

479
36:10.865 --> 36:12.665
Great! Welcome!

480
36:15.225 --> 36:16.425
Alright! Now,

481
36:16.505 --> 36:18.105
let's keep pushing!

482
36:18.185 --> 36:19.505
-Let's go! -Let's go!

483
36:23.225 --> 36:24.585
Looking forward to working with you.

484
36:24.665 --> 36:26.065
-Welcome. -Thank you.

485
36:54.185 --> 36:55.065
So what's going on?

486
36:56.065 --> 36:57.465
I wanted to surprise you.

487
36:57.545 --> 36:58.865
Surprise?

488
36:59.705 --> 37:01.465
Hi. I'm Xu Chi.

489
37:01.545 --> 37:02.825
First time here?

490
37:02.905 --> 37:05.705
-Yes. -What do you think of the place?

491
37:06.225 --> 37:07.265
It's nice.

492
37:07.785 --> 37:10.545
Just seems a little different from Maxmise's vibe.

493
37:10.625 --> 37:12.665
I noticed nobody's working late.

494
37:13.425 --> 37:15.105
We're a local consulting firm.

495
37:15.185 --> 37:16.985
And these past couple of years, we've been promoting

496
37:17.065 --> 37:18.185
a more relaxed way of working.

497
37:18.265 --> 37:19.825
We encourage working from home.

498
37:19.905 --> 37:21.545
Plus, with the consultant pool system,

499
37:21.625 --> 37:23.425
everyone's efficiency has gone way up.

500
37:23.505 --> 37:25.505
No more trading your health for your career.

501
37:26.105 --> 37:28.385
-Want some coffee? -No thanks.

502
37:28.905 --> 37:32.105
What's this consultant pool system you mentioned?

503
37:32.185 --> 37:35.025
It's a management system derived from the lawyer pool model.

504
37:37.305 --> 37:38.985
How do I put this?

505
37:39.585 --> 37:43.865
Traditional consulting firms are all team-based, right?

506
37:45.385 --> 37:49.585
Junior consultants can only follow a fixed partner team.

507
37:49.665 --> 37:52.625
So the work they're exposed to is pretty narrow.

508
37:52.705 --> 37:54.185
But with a consultant pool, it's different.

509
37:54.265 --> 37:57.785
Even young consultants can work on individual projects

510
37:57.865 --> 38:00.985
and communicate both ways with different teams.

511
38:01.585 --> 38:03.265
That way, young consultants

512
38:03.345 --> 38:07.465
can quickly find their own lane and domain.

513
38:07.545 --> 38:10.225
And there's less friction between teams.

514
38:11.985 --> 38:13.585
So? Interested in giving it a shot?

515
38:18.705 --> 38:21.065
Are you poaching me?

516
38:23.065 --> 38:27.825
Actually, people move between consulting firms all the time.

517
38:27.905 --> 38:30.985
Besides, my team is always hungry for talent.

518
38:32.705 --> 38:34.065
Thanks so much.

519
38:35.145 --> 38:36.505
But I'm doing pretty well at Maxmise.

520
38:38.025 --> 38:39.345
Plus,

521
38:40.185 --> 38:42.225
I'm actually Richard's girlfriend.

522
38:42.305 --> 38:44.985
So even if I were going to jump ship, I…

523
38:46.585 --> 38:48.825
But Richard is on another project,

524
38:48.905 --> 38:50.825
and his team is already full.

525
38:54.505 --> 38:57.585
Let me share a personal experience.

526
38:57.665 --> 39:02.865
Most of the time, people don't jump ship because they can't hack it where they are.

527
39:02.945 --> 39:05.625
It's because a wise person knows which ship to board.

528
39:07.265 --> 39:09.425
You're still an SBA at Maxmise, right?

529
39:11.665 --> 39:13.345
Here's the thing. Come work with me.

530
39:13.425 --> 39:15.265
I'll give you a consultant title.

531
39:15.345 --> 39:16.785
Once the next project wraps up,

532
39:16.865 --> 39:19.465
I'll recommend you for project manager.

533
39:21.985 --> 39:23.065
That's really tempting.

534
39:24.225 --> 39:25.465
But still, thank you.

535
39:26.105 --> 39:26.945
No problem.

536
39:27.625 --> 39:28.665
Think it over.

537
39:34.305 --> 39:35.385
Here's my card.

538
39:36.625 --> 39:38.785
-Thanks. -Great running into you here.

539
39:39.945 --> 39:41.745
That day you said here

540
39:41.825 --> 39:44.665
that suddenly hitting your goal felt like losing your direction.

541
39:45.665 --> 39:46.785
Honestly, me too.

542
39:47.385 --> 39:50.545
I've been at Maxmise for over a year and finished two projects.

543
39:50.625 --> 39:52.305
I've learned so much.

544
39:52.385 --> 39:54.545
By all logic, I should feel satisfied.

545
39:54.625 --> 39:56.505
But I keep remembering what you told me that day.

546
39:56.585 --> 39:59.385
You said work shouldn't be our whole life,

547
40:00.185 --> 40:02.945
and we should spend more time together going forward.

548
40:03.545 --> 40:05.185
But if I stay at Maxmise,

549
40:05.265 --> 40:08.345
it's really hard to do that and still keep up my pace of promotions.

550
40:08.425 --> 40:10.105
You know how it is.

551
40:10.185 --> 40:11.465
My track record at Maxmise right now

552
40:11.545 --> 40:12.985
is mostly the result of me grinding myself to the bone.

553
40:15.145 --> 40:18.425
So when Wang Yuan promised you a consultant title,

554
40:19.025 --> 40:20.345
you were tempted?

555
40:22.785 --> 40:25.225
The higher you go, the harder it is to move up.

556
40:25.305 --> 40:28.505
It took Lin a full five years to become a consultant.

557
40:29.345 --> 40:31.025
I don't want to waste that much time,

558
40:31.545 --> 40:33.505
and I don't want to be stuck in the same pigeonhole forever.

559
40:34.105 --> 40:35.865
But C&amp;C's consultant pool

560
40:35.945 --> 40:38.465
gives me way more flexibility to pick projects that actually fit me.

561
40:39.465 --> 40:42.225
Lin and Tianna both told me to grab this opportunity.

562
40:43.145 --> 40:44.145
Xinzhi,

563
40:44.225 --> 40:46.985
I really do want to have more time with you.

564
40:47.065 --> 40:50.265
Now that you're coming to work with me, of course, I'm happy.

565
40:51.625 --> 40:55.425
But it would've been better if you'd given me a heads-up.

566
40:56.105 --> 40:59.065
After all, I know C&amp;C better than you do.

567
40:59.825 --> 41:01.425
-I… -Let me go pour you some tea.

568
41:04.145 --> 41:06.825
I wanted to tell you,

569
41:06.905 --> 41:09.545
but you were traveling nonstop for a while there.

570
41:09.625 --> 41:12.545
And my second and third interviews didn't go that great.

571
41:12.625 --> 41:13.745
So I was even more scared to tell you.

572
41:13.825 --> 41:16.185
What if I got cut? That'd be so embarrassing.

573
41:16.265 --> 41:19.105
Good thing I ended up getting the offer.

574
41:20.545 --> 41:22.145
Just to be clear upfront.

575
41:22.225 --> 41:25.945
I don't want people gossiping that I only got in because of you.

576
41:27.425 --> 41:29.745
So don't put me on your team yet.

577
41:30.345 --> 41:32.145
Let me work a project or two with other teams

578
41:32.225 --> 41:34.105
in the consultant pool and become a veteran.

579
41:34.185 --> 41:36.665
Have you gotten addicted to going undercover?

580
41:37.305 --> 41:39.625
Our relationship is not exactly a secret.

581
41:40.225 --> 41:41.905
I was gonna talk to you about it.

582
41:41.985 --> 41:44.145
Once I get through this busy stretch, let's go on a trip.

583
41:44.905 --> 41:47.945
I'm in no mood for a trip right now.

584
41:54.625 --> 41:55.625
Here's what I'm thinking.

585
41:56.745 --> 42:01.265
Well, career-wise, I want people to see us as,

586
42:01.345 --> 42:03.265
not exactly equals,

587
42:03.345 --> 42:04.865
but at least not too far apart in rank.

588
42:05.745 --> 42:08.345
Once I finish two projects, I'll definitely make project manager.

589
42:08.425 --> 42:11.665
And even if some people in the industry know about us,

590
42:11.745 --> 42:13.345
hardly anyone at the company does.

591
42:13.945 --> 42:17.065
So I don't want to broadcast it.

592
42:17.145 --> 42:20.785
At least not until everyone here actually recognizes what I can do.

593
42:23.105 --> 42:25.385
Just wait for me. Please?

594
42:27.385 --> 42:28.225
Okay.

595
42:31.425 --> 42:34.185
Miss Xu, on behalf of C&amp;C, welcome.

596
42:40.825 --> 42:43.665
Now we can commute,

597
42:43.745 --> 42:45.745
travel for work, and go home together.

598
42:54.985 --> 42:56.825
So don't be mad at me anymore.

599
42:57.385 --> 42:58.225
I'm not mad.

600
42:59.425 --> 43:00.625
You really aren't?

601
43:01.865 --> 43:02.865
Really?

602
43:08.425 --> 43:10.305
-Then I'm heading out to work. -Go on.

603
43:18.945 --> 43:23.025
"Honey, we can commute,

604
43:23.105 --> 43:25.425
travel for work, and go home together."

605
43:25.505 --> 43:26.785
"Alright?"

606
43:26.865 --> 43:28.305
-Are you out of your mind? -You're such a menace.

607
43:29.185 --> 43:30.945
You… Wait.

608
43:31.025 --> 43:35.545
So you mean you have to keep it low-key at work,

609
43:35.625 --> 43:38.505
sneak around with an office romance,

610
43:38.585 --> 43:40.545
and hide it all from your colleagues?

611
43:44.105 --> 43:45.905
Nice.

612
43:45.985 --> 43:47.465
Now the tables have turned.

613
43:47.545 --> 43:48.585
So you're in charge now.

614
43:50.185 --> 43:51.825
That's called adding some spice.

615
43:53.225 --> 43:54.385
Spice.

616
43:54.465 --> 43:57.025
Didn't you and Zhao Heng used to be like this?

617
43:59.305 --> 44:01.585
I don't really get this "spice" thing of yours.

618
44:01.665 --> 44:02.705
Me and Zhao Heng…

619
44:02.785 --> 44:05.865
He completely dances to my tune. Okay?

620
44:05.945 --> 44:07.385
Can't say the same for you and Ye Xinzhi, though.

621
44:08.505 --> 44:10.345
Who says? Ye Xinzhi treats me great.

622
44:10.425 --> 44:12.545
Way better than Zhao Heng treats you.

623
44:15.025 --> 44:16.585
Zhao Heng treats me pretty well.

624
44:18.545 --> 44:22.865
But honestly, after you left Maxmise, I've been thinking about quitting too.

625
44:23.985 --> 44:24.865
Go back to your dad's company?

626
44:27.345 --> 44:28.985
Though my family has accepted Zhao Heng now,

627
44:29.065 --> 44:31.185
I'm still not sure deep down.

628
44:31.265 --> 44:35.185
I figure it might be better if I go work at my dad's company.

629
44:35.785 --> 44:38.025
Once I'm settled, Zhao Heng can come help me

630
44:38.105 --> 44:40.185
or stay in consulting.

631
44:40.265 --> 44:42.225
Either way, I've got options.

632
44:42.305 --> 44:43.545
So you're not gonna be a partner?

633
44:44.265 --> 44:47.985
Ever since I met you, becoming a partner was your big dream.

634
44:48.065 --> 44:52.625
Girl, running Siwei Group and being a partner at Maxmise

635
44:52.705 --> 44:55.065
aren't even in the same league. Okay?

636
44:55.145 --> 44:56.585
That's not what you used to say.

637
44:57.465 --> 44:59.305
I get it now. It's the magic of love.

638
44:59.385 --> 45:01.705
Does Zhao Heng know you're doing all this for him?

639
45:01.785 --> 45:04.185
Well, I… I…

640
45:04.265 --> 45:09.585
I'm going back to Siwei Group to take back my spot as the heiress.

641
45:09.665 --> 45:11.825
He's just playing a supporting role. He doesn't need to know all this.

642
45:13.545 --> 45:15.745
I get it. He's Bu Shoes-On.

643
45:15.825 --> 45:17.345
I'm Shoes-Off.

644
45:18.345 --> 45:21.625
Hey, I gotta say, you're such a menace,

645
45:21.705 --> 45:24.465
-I swear. -Who are you calling a menace?

646
45:25.545 --> 45:26.905
B.t let me warn you,

647
45:26.985 --> 45:30.225
If you go back and your dad sticks you in some department with a fancy name,

648
45:30.305 --> 45:33.745
like PR or venture capital, don't take it.

649
45:33.825 --> 45:37.265
Go for the departments that actually control the company's core business.

650
45:38.385 --> 45:40.585
Don't worry. I know what I'm doing.

651
45:40.665 --> 45:41.985
-That's good then. -There's a vacancy

652
45:42.065 --> 45:43.425
for a manager at the Finance Center.

653
45:43.505 --> 45:44.785
I'll go fill that spot first.

654
45:45.585 --> 45:47.905
With my experience from the Celestial Insurance project,

655
45:47.985 --> 45:50.145
I should be able to handle it. Should be fine.

656
45:50.745 --> 45:51.545
Good.
